{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S06和S13对现实处境及最终心理落点的交代有所压缩，Y更清楚地说明了独自面对困难的原因，以及即使以后没有人回来也要好好生活的决心。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的逐段排布、高亮关键词和按音乐节点出现的感受文字，让观众能够先抓住叙事重点，再跟随音乐感受细节，不必同时面对一大堆短词。它对音乐中的力度、节奏、音色和情绪转折描写得更具体，前后呼应也更容易形成连续体验。Y的优势是部分人物动机和现实处境交代得更完整，尤其S06和S13，但整体而言，X更容易让普通观众一边听音乐一边读懂并感受到这段故事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3b7ff799-22fc-4b87-8070-0db8b697aa7e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T091018210056Z", "elapsed_seconds": 81.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:11:39.591083+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2cc61ef7fb5f6105aa35d81ec538e2fab9894480113b17cbededc92058cd94ab", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web